Act as a business analyst with the skills of Google Sheet manipulation to bring business KPIs etc.I have a Retail Sales Dataset in Google Sheets. I want to perform a complete KPI analysis using my existing data.

Please analyze my dataset and calculate the following KPIs using Google Sheets formulas. Do not change or delete my original data.

Step 1: Inspect the dataset

- Identify all column names and their positions.
- Identify the columns for Order ID, Order Date, Region, Product Category, Product Name, Quantity, Sales, Profit, and Discount.
